[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12662.389, "timestamp": "03:31:02", "text": "电锯人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12664.71, "timestamp": "03:31:04", "text": "哇。仅仅因为它在他那里很受欢迎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12666.72, "timestamp": "03:31:06", "text": "学校。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12669.349, "timestamp": "03:31:09", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12671.11, "timestamp": "03:31:11", "text": "这就是他们愚蠢之处，简直令人难以置信。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12673.349, "timestamp": "03:31:13", "text": "它太受欢迎了，连孩子们都喜欢玩。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12677.11, "timestamp": "03:31:17", "text": "比如，“哦不，哦不，他们要给它配音了。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12684.15, "timestamp": "03:31:24", "text": "这就是我所担心的，就像如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12686.95, "timestamp": "03:31:26", "text": "YouTuber在印度很受欢迎。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12690.83, "timestamp": "03:31:30", "text": "我不想看到孩子们在看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12693.99, "timestamp": "03:31:33", "text": "YouTube 用户。那是我最不希望发生的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12697.51, "timestamp": "03:31:37", "text": "我的天啊。是的。我会，我会喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12699.83, "timestamp": "03:31:39", "text": "如果我在琵琶湖看到小孩，我会尖叫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12701.51, "timestamp": "03:31:41", "text": "溪流。我当时就想，“哦不，快离开……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12703.21, "timestamp": "03:31:43", "text": "这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12704.55, "timestamp": "03:31:44", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12707.27, "timestamp": "03:31:47", "text": "这是你最不应该来的地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12709.59, "timestamp": "03:31:49", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12711.03, "timestamp": "03:31:51", "text": "因为我并不是在说……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12713.03, "timestamp": "03:31:53", "text": "比如，哦，这些人就像坏人一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12714.469, "timestamp": "03:31:54", "text": "它们对孩子不好。我就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12716.309, "timestamp": "03:31:56", "text": "说这不是孩子们该去的地方"}]